  },
  "notes": [
    "文档书: 精选联盟API（版本 V1.01）",
    "公共参数（method/app_key/access_token/param_YOUR_SECRET_KEY_method）见 doudian/agent/_common.json"
  ],
  "params": [
    {
      "name": "items",
      "in": "body",
      "type": "array",
      "required": true,
      "description": "批量报名记录, 每个元素是单商品报名记录，商品不能重复，重复的只取第一个",
      "example": "",
      "_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "name": "product_id",
      "in": "body",
      "type": "string",
      "required": true,
      "description": "商品id",
      "example": "1235123412",
      "_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "name": "origin_activity_id",
      "in": "body",
      "type": "string",
      "required": true,
      "description": "- 如果是团长投放商品\n   - 如果原始团是招商活动，传原始团长活动id\n   - 如果原始团是托管商品，传0\n- 如果是商家投放商品，传-1",
      "example": "123412",
      "_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "name": "activity_ids",
      "in": "body",
      "type": "string",
      "required": true,
      "description": "报名的团长活动列表，逗号分割（限制最多3个）",
      "example": "623462,1235125",
      "_depth": 1
    }
  ],
  "responseParams": [
    {
      "name": "BaseResponse",
      "type": "object",
      "description": "报名结果",
      "example": ""
    },
    {
      "name": "fail_item",
      "type": "array",
      "description": "添加失败的记录（key：商品，value：<活动：失败原因>）",
